## The archive
{{if .Ready}}
The archive is the folder {{.Archive}}. It has this layout:

- bin/meeting starts a meeting session.
- prompts/base.md is the base prompt every session starts from.
- instructions/projects/ holds one file per project, named after the project's key.
- instructions/people/ holds one file per person, and a folder per person with one file per project.
- meetings/ holds the saved meetings.

The schema of every instruction file (headings, order, precedence, an example of each) is in instructions/README.md in the archive. Read it first. Do not guess a heading.

